{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Space Exploitation</strong> is a space mining game featuring 2D physics and a destructible environment. Set in the distant future where mining ship pilots work for exploitative corporations; you will have to upgrade your ship, master the asteroids, and make difficult decisions if you want to survive and secure your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D Physics + Pixel Art: </strong>Chunky pixel art and physics provide satisfying crashes, shots, and explosions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Equipment:</strong>\u00a0Upgrade your ship and choose the best tools for the job, but remember; everything has a price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master The Asteroids:</strong> The resources of the asteroid fields aren't easy to take; you will need both courage and caution if you want to succeed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Bureaucracy:</strong>\u00a0Choose how your story unfolds; stick to corporate law to survive, or take your future into your own hands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656660/extras/13de0065b19b914d30e87bd6d54368c7.poster.avif?t=1759840505\" width=1120 height=740 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656660/extras/13de0065b19b914d30e87bd6d54368c7.webm?t=1759840505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656660/extras/13de0065b19b914d30e87bd6d54368c7.mp4?t=1759840505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/36566